invariant: INV-12
file: handshake_post.c
catches: unit
reason: the KeyUpdate this side sends is sealed with the receive direction's
  rec_dir, so one key and sequence counter now covers records that go both
  ways. bin/unit opens the answer to a request under this side's write key

--- old
    if (rec_seal(&t->wr, REC_HANDSHAKE, msg, sizeof msg, t->tx, sizeof t->tx, &out_len) != 0 ||
--- new
    if (rec_seal(&t->rd, REC_HANDSHAKE, msg, sizeof msg, t->tx, sizeof t->tx, &out_len) != 0 ||
